+Status: design v0.4.8, after the pilot (31.10.2026) and gate G1 (1.11.2026), before the deposit of the preregistration. The pilot outputs are in `data/raw/` and `results/pilot_*`; they are excluded from every confirmatory analysis. Nothing here is a result of the study.
 
